@page "/duas"
@using global::Quran.Data

<PageTitle>Duas</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-4">
    <div class="row align-items-center mb-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto text-center">
            <h3 class="display-6 fw-bold" lang="ar">اخْلَاقُ اللَّهِ AL-KHAALIQ [UMdali, The Creator]</h3>
            <h4 class="mb-3">ALLAH TA’ALA IS THE CREATOR OF EVERYTHING</h4>
            <p class="lead mb-2" lang="ar">اَللَّهُ تَعَالَى خَلَقَ الْحَيَوَانَاتِ عَلَى الْأَرْضِ، وَالسَّمَكَ فِي الْبَحْرِ، وَالطَّيْرَ فِي السَّمَاءِ.</p>
            <p class="lead mb-2">Allah Ta’ala created the animals on the land, the fish in the sea and the birds in the sky.</p>
            <p class="lead mb-2" lang="zu">UNkulunkulu uTa’ala wadala izilwane emhlabeni, izinhlanzi olwandle, nezinyoni ezulwini.</p>
            <p class="lead mb-2">Everything that we can see and everything that we cannot see is created by Allah Ta’ala.</p>
            <p class="lead mb-0">Allah Ta’ala created the day so we can work and the night so we can sleep.</p>
            <p class="lead mb-0" lang="zu">UNkulunkulu uTa’ala wadala usuku lokuthi sisebenze nobusuku bokuthi silale.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">Common Duas</h3>
            <div class="list-group">
                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">I seek refuge in Allah from the accursed Satan</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">أَعُوذُ بِاللَّهِ مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngiyabuthola usizo lukaNkulunkulu ekubeni ngisindiswe kuSathane othiweyo.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> I seek refuge in Allah from the accursed Satan.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When beginning a task</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngegunya likaNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In the name of Allah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When thanking someone</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">جَزَاكَ اللَّهُ خَيْرًا</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> UJehova akusize; akubusise.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> May Allah Ta’ala reward you.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">Before eating</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngesigameko sikaNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In the name of Allah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">After eating</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Siyabonga kuNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> All praise is due to Allah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When entering the home</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ وَلَجْنَا</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngegunya likaNkulunkulu singena.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In the name of Allah we enter.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When leaving the home</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى اللَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngegunya likaNkulunkulu, ngithembela kuNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In the name of Allah, I place my trust in Allah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When waking up</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَ مَا أَمَاتَنَا</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Siyabonga kuNkulunkulu osiphilezile ngemva kokufa kwethu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> All praise is for Allah who gave us life after causing us to die.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">Before sleeping</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِكَ اللَّهُمَّ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngegama lakho, Nkosi, ngiyafa futhi ngiphinde ngiphile.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In Your name, O Allah, I die and I live.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">After sneezing</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Siyabonga kuNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> All praise is due to Allah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When hearing someone sneeze</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">يَرْحَمُكَ اللَّهُ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> UNkulunkulu akube nesihawu kuwe.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> May Allah have mercy on you.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">Before entering the bathroom</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْخُبْثِ وَالْخَبَائِثِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Nkosi, ngiyabuthola ukungavikeleki kokubi.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> O Allah, I seek refuge in You from the male and female devils.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">After using the bathroom</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">غُفْرَانَكَ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngicela uxolo lwakho.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> I seek Your forgiveness.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="list-group-item">
                    <h5 class="mb-1">When beginning a task</h5>
                    <p class="mb-1 fw-semibold" lang="ar">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ</p>
                    <p class="mb-1 text-muted"><strong>Zulu:</strong> Ngegunya likaNkulunkulu.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>English:</strong> In the name of Allah.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

